WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:03.000
[Soft music and glass tones]
Leadlight: Glass Cutter. Enter the atelier.

00:03.000 --> 00:08.000
Cut by eye. Aim for the requested proportion.

00:08.000 --> 00:15.500
Build a streak. Six good cuts make a window.

00:15.500 --> 00:20.000
Let the light in. Add a window to your collection.

00:20.000 --> 00:24.000
Leadlight: Glass Cutter. Endless play. No timer.
